{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/ColoredCow/frappe-lms/pull/13","repo":"ColoredCow/frappe-lms","number":13,"set":"agent","source":"claude-code-open","title":"fix: clear radio/checkbox selection state when navigating between quiz questions","body":"## Summary\n\n- Quiz answer options (radio/checkbox) were not being visually cleared when navigating to the next question\n- `resetQuestion()` correctly reset the `selectedOptions` JS state to `[0,0,0,0]`, but without a reactive `:checked` binding Vue had no way to update the DOM — so the browser kept the previously-checked input selected\n- Added `:checked=\"selectedOptions[index - 1] === 1\"` to both the radio and checkbox inputs so their visual state is fully controlled by `selectedOptions`\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Start a quiz with multiple questions\n- [ ] Select an answer on Q1, click Check → Next\n- [ ] Verify Q2 renders with no pre-selected answer\n- [ ] Repeat for MCQ (single-answer) and multiple-choice question types\n- [ ] Verify selected answers still submit correctly\n\nFixes #287\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","authorType":"User","additions":783,"deletions":254,"changedFiles":39,"files":[{"path":".github/helper/install.sh","additions":1,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/ci.yml","additions":3,"deletions":0},{"path":"cypress/e2e/course_creation.cy.js","additions":12,"deletions":11},{"path":"frontend/src/App.vue","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"frontend/src/components/CourseCardOverlay.vue","additions":9,"deletions":4},{"path":"frontend/src/components/EmptyState.vue","additions":1,"deletions":3},{"path":"frontend/src/components/Modals/AssignmentForm.vue","additions":3,"deletions":3},{"path":"frontend/src/components/Modals/Question.vue","additions":9,"deletions":12},{"path":"frontend/src/components/Quiz.vue","additions":2,"deletions":0},{"path":"frontend/src/components/Settings/Evaluators.vue","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"frontend/src/components/Set